{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0001","name":"曹参","evidence":["wudi-q-o001"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o001-wudi-p0001","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o001"]},{"id":"wudi-m-p002-wudi-p0001","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["wudi-q-p002"]},{"id":"wudi-m-p137-wudi-p0001","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["wudi-q-p137"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-q-o001","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-acdd0481f4a63ccf47c8","layer":"original","quote":"太祖武皇帝〖1〗，沛国谯人也〖2〗。姓曹，讳操〖3〗，字孟德。汉相国参之后〖4〗。﹝一﹞桓帝世〖5〗，曹腾为中常侍、大长秋〖6〗，封费亭侯。﹝二﹞养子嵩嗣，官至太尉〖7〗；莫能审其生出本末〖8〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":101,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p002","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-43620357ba73f1cfc4aa","layer":"pei","quote":"王沈《魏书》曰：“其先出于黄帝。当高阳世，陆终之子曰安，是为曹姓。周武王克殷，存先世之后，封曹侠于邾。春秋之世，与于盟会；逮至战国，为楚所灭。子孙分流，或家于沛。汉高祖之起，曹参以功封平阳侯，世袭爵土。绝而复绍，至今嫡嗣国于容城。”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":13,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-565d43f43b4b816d5e23","start":0,"end":116,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p137","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-24734f45162f67feba71","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《魏书》曰：“初置卫尉官。秋八月，令曰：‘昔伊挚、傅说，出于贱人；管仲，桓公贼也：皆用之以兴。萧何、曹参，县吏也；韩信、陈平，负污辱之名，有见笑之耻：卒能成就王业，声著千载。吴起贪将，杀妻自信，散金求官，母死不归；然在魏，秦人不敢东向；在楚，则三晋不敢南谋。今天下得无有至德之人，放在民间；及果勇不顾，临敌力战；若文俗之吏，高才异质，或堪为将守；负污辱之名，见笑之行，或不仁不孝，而有治国用兵之术？其各举所知，勿有所遗。’”","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":395,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c3068c1bfda4e0f833f0","start":0,"end":215,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
